"Hiroshima workshop. This workshop covers two levels for using pgRouting: "
"`Basic`_ and `Advanced`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../build/docs/general-intro/introduction.rst:15
msgid "Basic"
msgstr ""

#: ../../build/docs/general-intro/introduction.rst:17
msgid ""
"This level will demonstrate the routing functionality by providing "
"examples using |osm-web| road network data from Hiroshima. Covering "
"topics from how to prepare the data, making routing queries, "
"understanding the results, up to writing a custom 'plpgsql' function that"
" can be integrated with other FOSS tools."
msgstr ""

